jpeg"/><pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 09:57:42 +0100</pubDate></item><item><title>(Research) Ancient tooth proteins reveal Homo erectus genetic legacy in modern humans</title><link>https://leakeyfoundation.org/homo-erectus-may-have-left-a-genetic-legacy-in-people-today/</link><description>&lt;b&gt;Source:&lt;/b&gt; The Leakey Foundation&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;A new study, utilizing ancient tooth proteins, indicates that Homo erectus populations left a small but detectable genetic legacy within modern human genomes. This research provides evidence of interbreeding or shared ancestry, contributing to our understanding of human evolutionary history and genetic diversity. This discovery offers new insights for UK/EU researchers and students in anthropology, genetics, and human evolution.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;small&gt;&lt;b&gt;How did this land?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=https%3A//leakeyfoundation.org/homo-erectus-may-have-left-a-genetic-legacy-in-people-today/&amp;signal=3&amp;source=The%20Leakey%20Foundation&amp;type=rss&amp;context=amazingly_hopeful%20%7C%20Topic%3A%20Ancient%20tooth%20proteins%20reveal%20Homo%20erectus%20genetic%20legacy%20in%20modern%20humans&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;🥇✅ Wow, I Feel Positive, Inspired, Impressed&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=https%3A//leakeyfoundation.org/homo-erectus-may-have-left-a-genetic-legacy-in-people-today/&amp;signal=2&amp;source=The%20Leakey%20Foundation&amp;type=rss&amp;context=pretty_positive%20%7C%20Topic%3A%20Ancient%20tooth%20proteins%20reveal%20Homo%20erectus%20genetic%20legacy%20in%20modern%20humans&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration